<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cantinho dos Bolos - Receitas Caseiras</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #fdf6e3;
